# The other Mac's word that the link can't carry the quality (LinkWarning), faked here (a loopback
# host never falls behind): the launcher's banner and a window's toolbar warning say so and offer the
# quality it recommends; the banner's button sends it; both go once the link keeps up.
wait apps 30
expect linkWarning.button !contains Use
linkwarning behind
expect linkWarning.button == Use Low
snap linkwarning-launcher.png
click 846 94
expect stream.bitrate == 4000000
click 75 242
wait stream 15
expect streamWindows.0.toolbar contains sill.linkWarning
snap linkwarning-window.png all
linkwarning clear
expect linkWarning.button !contains Use
expect streamWindows.0.toolbar !contains sill.linkWarning
